@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
start
:1. Establish the working context\n(start from dev, record base SHA,\nread AGENTS.md, docs:find);
:2. Set one task contract\n(outcome, scope, acceptance criteria,\nprerequisites, focused check);
:3. Assign a complete bounded handoff\n(one worker per unit);
:4. Verify once, at the right depth\n(static -> focused -> full CI);
:5. Close the task\n(report evidence, improve repeatability);
stop
@enduml
